{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"拟凝聚层的忠实平坦下降"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"拟凝聚层的忠实平坦下降"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>拟凝聚层的忠实平坦下降, 说的是"},{"Local":{"url":"拟凝聚层","text":"拟凝聚层"}},{"Plain":"函子 $\\mathsf{QCoh} \\colon \\mathsf{Sch} \\to \\mathsf{Cat}$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦景","text":"平坦拓扑"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"景上的层","text":"层"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}